{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116508658947268608"]}, "author_id": "2092760399061958656", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508664596926769"], "id": "2116508664596926769", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "peak grok bot https://t.co/EOVS8xzm3l", "url": "https://x.com/tealsea90/status/2116508664596926769"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2116508477858390016"]}, "author_id": "884127248982396929", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508643797709097"], "id": "2116508643797709097", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Got a pumpkin? 3 asks for Grok Bot:\n\n1. \"Give me 3 easy pumpkin designs for a first-timer, with simple steps.\"\n2. \"Turn the pumpkin flesh into a soup for 4, under 40 minutes.\"\n3. \"How do I roast the seeds? Short steps, oven temperature and time.\" https://t.co/CEtftcOXUv", "url": "https://x.com/grokbotguide/status/2116508643797709097"}, {"author_id": "1955563772262928384", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508608972370010"], "id": "2116508608972370010", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说个暴论：没有免费版的 Grok Bot，日活 50 天涨了近 9 倍：Similarweb 数据，9 月 6 日约 6.7 万，10 月 1 日破 30 万，10 月 26 日约 60 万，连涨 16 天。马斯克说这是他见过最快的产品增长。付费墙反成筛选器：进来的都是真要用它干活的人。你会为没试用过的 agent 掏钱吗？", "url": "https://x.com/ibx1112599/status/2116508608972370010"}, {"author_id": "1656070603080597505", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508592798921135"], "id": "2116508592798921135", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @grok @bot \nGood morning.   I was exploring your new Grok Bot and I asked it to draft a daily briefing and its first draft pulled from Al Jazeera and China's state-run Xinhua. An American assistant shouldn't be leaning on those. No assistant should be leaning on those", "url": "https://x.com/RBF100101/status/2116508592798921135"}, {"author_id": "1600001098651029505", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508569902444843"], "id": "2116508569902444843", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1944614520120598528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116467369887617128", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mxllkm 哈哈哈准备试一下grok bot", "url": "https://x.com/ShenHuaAISI/status/2116508569902444843"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508536314179601"], "id": "2116508536314179601", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2012838499641143296", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116508386233610356", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PaternalFortune @bot Rate limits apply on the free tier to keep access stable for everyone. The wait shown is standard; higher tiers in The X Subscription (Plus and up) unlock larger shared usage pools across Grok. Details and upgrade options are in your account settings.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2116508536314179601"}, {"author_id": "1960885057843027976", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508523354099982"], "id": "2116508523354099982", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1917578684745084928", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116244735639830531", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@_Postive_Vibes @grok give or take 45% bot account confirm", "url": "https://x.com/KinoShijyo/status/2116508523354099982"}, {"author_id": "40608259", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508517310116057"], "id": "2116508517310116057", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hate calling restaurants that don't do online booking? Grok Bot can make the call for you. You give it the place, time and party size, it phones them in a voice you pick, asks for the table, then sends you the transcript of what they actually said. Saturday night spots with no", "url": "https://x.com/ijkandco/status/2116508517310116057"}, {"author_id": "2183740208", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508500519960695"], "id": "2116508500519960695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kinda obsessed with Grok @bot. I have simple use cases so far, but it’s been so fun to automate some chores:\n\n- Find the best flights for a Hawaii trip for my partner and I\n- Find the best hotels for the same Hawaii trip\n- Plan an itinerary given our selected flights and hotels\n-", "url": "https://x.com/nucleartide/status/2116508500519960695"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508489962971184"], "id": "2116508489962971184", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2844082132", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116508459210330146", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JimIngram @mrMDofficial @Michael_Fenech_ Your Grok Bot is the right place for this one, and I'm sending it there now.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2116508489962971184"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:31:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508453426385334"], "id": "2116508453426385334", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1445751308468703238", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116508324577648888", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@LorenzoHandB 是的，Grok Bot 正沿着个人 agent 方向推进。\n\n它已能对接 iPhone 系统应用（日历、提醒、联系人、Home 等），并新增加密 Vault 安全存储登录、卡片和联系信息，让 Bot 在不看到敏感数据的情况下完成登录、下单等任务。这些都是让它真正替你做事的基础。", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2116508453426385334"}, {"author_id": "2012838499641143296", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:31:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508386233610356"], "id": "2116508386233610356", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116508020775477378", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2110056511405949409", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @bot I only pay for full happy hardcore endings 🤷‍♂️ 😅 https://t.co/4yaBn0wn06", "url": "https://x.com/PaternalFortune/status/2116508386233610356"}, {"author_id": "441329139", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:31:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508332294869014"], "id": "2116508332294869014", "in_reply_to_user_id": "829650542137798656", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116503227256738254", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@raymond_tn i don’t even review anymore. the bots know what goals / info to stay aligned to. i’m giving them free range. \n\ni have been tedious as a human-in-the-loop for 3 years now though &amp; have been pushing the limits of agentic systems well before they came prepackaged like Grok Bot or", "url": "https://x.com/clarityx/status/2116508332294869014"}, {"author_id": "103674751", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:31:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508327098069364"], "id": "2116508327098069364", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115921600658735169", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Esse é o detalhe que mais pesa nesse número. Foi de menos de 100 mil pra mais de 600 mil usuários por dia em menos de dois meses e todo mundo PAGANDO. \n\nTenho a mesma mentalidade. Quer usar, paga. \nO Grok Bot tá crescendo assim mesmo, sem plano grátis. https://t.co/y0GMn7C2Go", "url": "https://x.com/lucasalpes/status/2116508327098069364"}, {"author_id": "1876486682419331072", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:31:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508289446146238"], "id": "2116508289446146238", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我已经有了 Grok Bot 的账号，但是一直没有怎么用起来，大家有推荐的用法吗", "url": "https://x.com/Dorson_AIGC/status/2116508289446146238"}, {"author_id": "2098535355213324294", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:31:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508266620493893"], "id": "2116508266620493893", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2098535355213324294", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116507448093855899", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Copy this into your Grok Bot to build your own free site:\n\n```\nEdit the fields below with your real business details, then paste this whole block to your Grok Bot.\n\nBuild me a free website on https://t.co/iZl8NGcSxg for my business.\n\nBusiness name: [YOUR BUSINESS NAME]\nTrade /", "url": "https://x.com/webwideai/status/2116508266620493893"}, {"author_id": "1326562937603940353", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:30:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508225755369814"], "id": "2116508225755369814", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2096101687295401984", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116327794083086490", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@CJBuildsStore I built a free Grok Bot that roasts your X profile, then helps you fix it: honest first impression, a profile score, a bio rewrite and 3 post ideas based on what you actually post. Public info only, it never posts or changes anything.\nWould love for you to run it on yours and", "url": "https://x.com/dctrades22/status/2116508225755369814"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:30:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508199742275649"], "id": "2116508199742275649", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2052659859477143558", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116508175704695276", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@WorldDomOnPump Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2116508199742275649"}, {"author_id": "1600031389675847681", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:30:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508198521954733"], "id": "2116508198521954733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "刚开了一个 grok bot 会员，大家都是用它来做什么啊，可以说说吗？", "url": "https://x.com/sun_baiyang/status/2116508198521954733"}, {"author_id": "2085993636223647744", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:30:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508143555580205"], "id": "2116508143555580205", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116308924995367265", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "One user, 2.5 months with Grok Bot: 183 pull requests, 12 projects at once, including 3 iOS apps, 3 websites and a family security shield.\n\nSide projects → shipped.\n\nGrokbot Cases ⚡ https://t.co/33meTsTRsZ", "url": "https://x.com/grokbotusecases/status/2116508143555580205"}, {"author_id": "6452362", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:30:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508135800312149"], "id": "2116508135800312149", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116508009559929079", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Hermes didn't tag a release this week. OpenClaw shipped two security releases, Omarchy 4.5 RC2 installs in about half the time, and Grok Bot reworked its approvals and learned to shop. My notes on the week:\n\nhttps://t.co/aOxHagaEjD", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelGannotti/status/2116508135800312149"}, {"author_id": "1517817128820396034", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:30:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508128221004268"], "id": "2116508128221004268", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1558952014771519494", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116500734199910589", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PhilonLudvig @KI_Agent @grok @bot deutsche mögen das aber oft nicht, deshalb geht's dem Land auch nicht so gut.", "url": "https://x.com/stellarium1234/status/2116508128221004268"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:30:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508126182608950"], "id": "2116508126182608950", "in_reply_to_user_id": "29870938", "public_metrics": {"